{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/martinring/tmlanguage/master/tmlanguage.json",
  "name": "Sign",
  "scopeName": "source.sign",
  "patterns": [
    {
      "include": "#comments"
    },
    {
      "include": "#strings"
    },
    {
      "include": "#characters"
    },
    {
      "include": "#constants"
    },
    {
      "include": "#operators"
    }
  ],
  "repository": {
    "comments": {
      "comment": "string_and_comment.md §2: 行頭のバッククォートは、閉じの直後が後置演算子（@ ~ !）か空白のときだけ式になる。それ以外はコメント。同じ規則が alpha/javascript/sign.pegjs, documents/{ja-jp,en-us}/impl/syntax/grammar.pegjs, documents/{ja-jp,en-us}/guide/string_and_comment.md, tools/emacs/lisp/sign-mode.el にもある——直すときは全部直す",
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "comment.line.sign",
          "match": "^`(?![^`\n]*`[@~! ]).*$"
        }
      ]
    },
    "strings": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "string.quoted.other.sign",
          "begin": "`",
          "end": "`|$",
          "patterns": [
            {
              "name": "constant.character.escape.sign",
              "match": "\\\\."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "characters": {
      "comment": "文字の字面は `\\` と直後の1文字（sign.pegjs の charactor）。`\\_` も文字 `_`（U+005F）であって穴ではない（裁定 2026-09-28）——下の穴の規則（\\b_\\b）より先に取らないと、`\\_` の `_` が穴の色になる。tools/emacs/lisp/sign-mode.el の「エスケープ文字リテラル」と同じ規則",
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "constant.character.sign",
          "match": "\\\\."
        }
      ]
    },
    "constants": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "constant.language.unit.sign",
          "match": "\\b_\\b"
        }
      ]
    },
    "operators": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "keyword.control.sign",
          "match": "(###|##|#|@|\\$|')"
        },
        {
          "name": "entity.name.function.sign",
          "match": "(:|\\?)"
        },
        {
          "name": "support.type.sign",
          "match": "(~\\^|~/|~\\*|~-|~\\+|~|,)"
        },
        {
          "name": "support.function.builtin.sign",
          "match": "(==|!=|<=|>=|<|>|=)"
        },
        {
          "name": "support.function.builtin.sign",
          "match": "(\\|\\||&&|;;|!!|\\||&|;|!)"
        },
        {
          "name": "constant.language.sign",
          "match": "(<<|>>|\\+|-|\\*|/|%|\\^)"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}